## 🚦 Validation Checkpoints

### Checkpoint 1: After File Creation

When creating new files:

1. ✅ Run `read_lints` on the new file
2. ✅ Fix any linter errors
3. ✅ Ensure imports are correct
4. ✅ Ensure exports are used

### Checkpoint 2: After File Modification

When modifying existing files:

1. ✅ Run `read_lints` on modified files
2. ✅ Run typecheck on the package
3. ✅ Run lint on the package
4. ✅ Fix all errors introduced

### Checkpoint 3: Before Completing Task

Before marking task as complete:

1. ✅ Run `npm run validate:affected`
2. ✅ Verify all checks pass
3. ✅ Run `read_lints` on all modified files
4. ✅ Document any pre-existing errors (not caused by you)

